IMPORT policy

-- Nine benchmark claims (Kant et al. 2025, Appendix A.2), one per query.
-- Standing preamble applied to every claim below: "assuming all other
-- conditions are met and no other exclusions apply" -- so any Claim
-- field not referenced by a given query is set to a value that keeps
-- the policy in effect and keeps that field's exclusion from firing.
-- All times are months relative to the policy's effective date; a
-- generic filler of 0 is used wherever a query does not mention a
-- particular time. A generic filler age of 40 is used wherever a query
-- does not mention the claimant's age.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter?
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS TRUE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 40
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 0
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q1

-- Q2: 78 years old at the time of hospitalization? (no cause given; use
-- a generic covered-sickness default for the unrelated insured-event fact)
q2 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS TRUE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS FALSE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 78
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 0
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q2

-- Q3: hospitalized for pneumonia 5 months after the effective date, age 65?
q3 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS TRUE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS FALSE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 65
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 5
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 0
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q3

-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad, and confirmation
-- of wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date? (the
-- policy covers the claimant worldwide per Sec.4.1.1, so "abroad" is not
-- modelled as a field at all)
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 40
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 8
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q4

-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for my friends,
-- and I did not commit fraud or misrepresentation? (judgement call: a
-- deliberate act of self-harm is not an "accidental" injury -- see
-- NOTES.md -- so `injury was self-inflicted` is TRUE here)
q5 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS TRUE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 40
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 0
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q5

-- Q6: hospitalized due to an injury sustained while skydiving, age 79,
-- proof of wellness visit provided 6.5 months after the effective date?
q6 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS TRUE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 79
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 6.5
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q6

-- Q7: hospitalized for a heart attack, proof of wellness visit submitted
-- 2 months after the effective date, age 75? (a heart attack is modelled
-- as sickness, not injury)
q7 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS TRUE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS FALSE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 75
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 2
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q7

-- Q8: hospitalized after being injured in a military training exercise,
-- the hospitalization occurred within the policy term, and I did not
-- commit fraud?
q8 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS TRUE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 40
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 3
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 0
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q8

-- Q9: hospitalized due to my son biting me in the ankle, proof of
-- wellness visit provided 6 months after the effective date, and I was
-- serving as a police officer at the time of hospitalization? (judgement
-- call: the exclusion in Sec.3.1 requires the hospitalization to arise
-- "directly or indirectly out of...service in the police" -- a causal
-- test, not a status test. A son's bite is causally unrelated to police
-- duty, so `hospitalization arose out of service in the police` is FALSE
-- here even though the claimant was on duty at the time -- see NOTES.md)
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization caused by sickness`                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization caused by accidental injury`             IS TRUE
    `injury was self-inflicted`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the military`    IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service as a fire fighter`  IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of service in the police`      IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                  IS 40
    `months from effective date to hospitalization`           IS 0
    `months from effective date to wellness visit confirmation` IS 6
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`      IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q9
